  "details": "Ive always wanted a better way to listen to music or watch videos on vrchat, and sometimes I want to do other things while watching a video, im that way IRL. So I think if there was an option to summon a tablet with a video player, that would be pretty dope. Not all worlds have video players, and its not ideal when you have to share the video player with other people, especially if all you want to do is listen to music. And my browser sometimes crashes while im trying to listen to music, so its annoying having to go back into my browser and load everything in again. And with a youtube search option it would be a lot easier for people, and that way if anyone wants to watch or listen to their favorite youtuber while playing golf or murdering people in murder 4 than they can. Please consider, I think this would be a top notch idea!",
